# Thornplate Intimidator: with no card in hand Bot2 cannot discard, so is offered only to sacrifice or to lose 3 life. Bot2 has eight
# Memnites, casts every one on turn 2 (an empty hand, an empty library) and, as Intimidator enters on turn 3, discarding is refused;
# it chooses to lose 3 life (17) and keeps all eight.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Thornplate Intimidator
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite x8

